Run SH
chmod +x Tigernix-Install.sh
./Tigernix-Install.sh


START ERP13
./tigernix-bin --http-port=8069
./tigernix-bin --limit-time-real 36000 --http-port=8069


AUTO START FILE FOR SERVER
File name : tigernixerp13
> Move tigernixerp13 to /etc/init.d and dont forget to makesure daemon, configfile and user are correct.
> sudo /lib/systemd/systemd-sysv-install enable tigernixerp11
> systemctl daemon-reload
> sudo systemctl start tigernixerp13


--limit-time-real will kill any process if run over 36000 seconds
including when upgrade module, import data, etc